      "template": "T29 (ALLOSTATIC_MASTER_001)",
      "type": "OUTPUT",
      "description": "Sustained wanting without liking (approaching but not enjoying) has an allostatic cost \u2014 the motivational system is engaged without consummatory reward, producing stress."
    }
